atfdb.cijob  cijob:compA  comment:"Component tests, one half (see comptest.cijob)"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:compB  comment:"Unit, amc and editor tests, and the other half of the component tests (see comptest.cijob)"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:coverageA  comment:"Coverage of the unit and component tests; uploads its line counts"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:coverageB  comment:"Coverage of the suites that coverageA leaves out; uploads its line counts"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:covfinal  comment:"Merge the coverageA and coverageB line counts; check against dev.tgtcov"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:depscan  comment:"Scan of third-party dependencies against public advisories"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:memcheckA  comment:"Component tests under valgrind, first shard (see comptest.memcheck)"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:memcheckB  comment:"Component tests under valgrind, second shard (see comptest.memcheck)"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:memcheckC  comment:"Component tests under valgrind, third shard (see comptest.memcheck)"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:none  comment:"No CI job: a test tagged with it runs in no automated job"
atfdb.cijob  cijob:normalize  comment:"Default job, fast normalization & unit tests"
